    "updated_at": "2015-08-30T06:58:05Z",
    "body": "Thanks, WDYT of the fixup?\n\nFor @bzbarsky and @travisleithead: this shows up as a rounding error on https://www.chromestatus.com/metrics/feature/timeline/popularity/767. Looking at the raw numbers, it occurs on something like ~0.00001% of page views, and I would not be at all surprised to learn that a substantial portion of those are the very sandboxed advertisements that the change is intended to prevent from being confusingly malicious. It seems like a breaking change that's both low-risk and well worth making.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
