    "updated_at": "2015-08-31T04:13:42Z",
    "body": "@annevk You can track Mozilla's status here at https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1190641\n\nThe short summary is that we think it's probably reasonable, but https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1190641#c1 has concerns about how it interacts with `showModalDialog` (which doesn't open a \"dialog\" for purposes of this sandbox flag, hence the naming is a bit confusing).  Also, no one is actively planning to work on it in the next month at least, I suspect.\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
